      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "They need to change the IK system for full body tracking. Currently the viewpoint doesn’t actually follow the head. It seems to follow the hips which is why the viewpoint generally messes up when you bend over or even lay down.\n\nStand up straight, and put 1 finger in the middle of your screen and look in a mirror and just start bending forward. You’ll notice your viewpoint going way too far out than it should.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
